<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;MODEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Model is a software or method used for electronic structure computations."|</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"I refers to the narrator who used to love something and misses it."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YOUR SPLIT TESTING WINNER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Your Split Testing Winner is an event or outcome of a split testing process, likely related to online marketing or sales."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ONLINE REVIEW IMPACT FORECAST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Online Review Impact Forecast is a tool or process used to predict the effect of additional customer reviews on sales growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RETURN ON INVESTMENT CALCULATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Return on Investment Calculator is a tool used to measure the success of marketing strategies by calculating ROI."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;READABILITY SCORE CALCULATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Readability Score Calculator is a tool used to calculate various readability scores to assess content’s ease of reading."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TUNED IN CONTENT CALCULATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tuned In Content Calculator is a tool used to evaluate whether content is aligned with customer preferences or alienating potential customers."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONTENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Content refers to written material or marketing strategies that are being analyzed or optimized."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPLIT TESTING WINNER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Split Testing Winner is an event or outcome of a split testing process, likely related to online marketing or sales."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FLESCH-KINCAID READING EASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Flesch-Kincaid Reading Ease is a score used to measure the clarity and readability of text."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FLESCH-KINCAID GRADE LEVEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Flesch-Kincaid Grade Level is a score used to determine the level of education needed to understand a text."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUNNING FOG INDEX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gunning Fog Index is a score used to measure the complexity of a text."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLEMAN-LIAU INDEX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Coleman-Liau Index is a score used to estimate the grade level needed to comprehend a text."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SMOG INDEX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SMOG Index is a score used to measure the complexity of a text and the grade level needed to understand it."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUTOMATED READABILITY INDEX (ARI)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Automated Readability Index (ARI) is a score used to estimate the grade level needed to read a text."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SELF-FOCUSED CONTENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Self-Focused Content refers to content that is overly focused on the creator or brand without considering the audience."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CUSTOMER PREFERENCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Customer Preferences refer to the needs, desires, and expectations of the target audience."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POTENTIAL CUSTOMERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Potential Customers are individuals who might be interested in a product or service but have not yet engaged with it."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SALES GROWTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sales Growth refers to the increase in sales over time."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARKETING STRATEGIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marketing Strategies are the plans and tactics used to promote products or services."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARKETING SUCCESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marketing Success refers to the effectiveness of marketing efforts in achieving desired outcomes."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENGAGEMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Engagement refers to the level of interest and interaction from the target audience with the content or marketing efforts."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NOSTALGIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nostalgia refers to a sentimental longing or wistful affection for a period in the past."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OPTIMIZATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Optimization refers to the process of improving the efficiency or effectiveness of something."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALIENATING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alienating refers to the act of making someone feel isolated or estranged."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARKETING TOOLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marketing Tools are the various methods and technologies used to promote products or services."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CUSTOMER REVIEWS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Customer Reviews are feedback provided by customers about their experiences with a product or service."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL CUSTOMER REVIEWS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Additional Customer Reviews refer to extra reviews that can enhance the impact of marketing efforts."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SALES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sales refer to the act of selling goods or services."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ROI stands for Return on Investment, a measure of the profitability of a marketing campaign."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;I&quot;" target="&quot;CONTENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The narrator, I, expresses a past love and current miss for content, suggesting a personal connection to the content."</data>
      <data key="d5">"personal connection, nostalgia"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YOUR SPLIT TESTING WINNER&quot;" target="&quot;ONLINE REVIEW IMPACT FORECAST&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Your Split Testing Winner is associated with Online Review Impact Forecast as both are part of a broader marketing strategy."</data>
      <data key="d5">"marketing strategy, split testing"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YOUR SPLIT TESTING WINNER&quot;" target="&quot;RETURN ON INVESTMENT CALCULATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Your Split Testing Winner is linked to Return on Investment Calculator as both are tools for measuring the success of marketing efforts."</data>
      <data key="d5">"ROI measurement, marketing success"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YOUR SPLIT TESTING WINNER&quot;" target="&quot;READABILITY SCORE CALCULATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Your Split Testing Winner is connected to Readability Score Calculator as both are part of a comprehensive approach to optimizing content."</data>
      <data key="d5">"content optimization, marketing strategy"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YOUR SPLIT TESTING WINNER&quot;" target="&quot;TUNED IN CONTENT CALCULATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Your Split Testing Winner is related to Tuned In Content Calculator as both aim to improve the effectiveness of content in engaging customers."</data>
      <data key="d5">"customer engagement, marketing strategy"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
